        <mxCell id="aws_pros" value="PROS:&#xa;- Fully managed (no clusters)&#xa;- 10+ native connectors (auto-sync)&#xa;- S3 Vectors = ultra-low-cost storage&#xa;- Built-in chunking (5 strategies)&#xa;- Guardrails + citations included&#xa;- Pay-per-query pricing&#xa;- AgentCore for multi-step agents&#xa;- 30+ foundation models&#xa;&#xa;CONS:&#xa;- AWS-only (no multi-cloud)&#xa;- Limited fine-tuning control&#xa;- Less RAG pipeline flexibility&#xa;- Vendor lock-in" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=9;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#82b366;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="grp_aws">
