        <mxCell id="db_pros" value="PROS:&#xa;- Full code control (any framework)&#xa;- Fine-tune embedding + LLM on your data&#xa;- Multi-cloud (AWS / Azure / GCP)&#xa;- Unity Catalog governance (row/column-level)&#xa;- MLflow evaluation built-in&#xa;- Strong Spark/ETL ecosystem&#xa;- Custom retrieval strategies&#xa;&#xa;CONS:&#xa;- Cluster cost even when idle ($500-2000/mo)&#xa;- No built-in guardrails or citations&#xa;- Manual pipeline engineering required&#xa;- No native SaaS connectors&#xa;- Higher time-to-production&#xa;- Need custom chunking code" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=9;fillColor=#FFF9C4;strokeColor=#d6b656;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="grp_db">
